","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p032","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p035:m0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"毛璩","kind":"person","person_id":"m7n_39i_5bk","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p035","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p035:m0282","start":282,"end":284,"surface":"毛璩","kind":"person","person_id":"m7n_39i_5bk","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p035","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p032","text":"時益州刺史毛璩使其從孫祐之、參軍費恬送弟璠喪葬江陵，有眾二百，璩弟子脩之為玄屯騎校尉，誘玄以入蜀，玄從之。達枚回洲，恬與祐之迎擊玄，矢下如雨。玄嬖人丁仙期、萬蓋等以身敝玄，並中數十箭而死。玄被箭，其子升輒拔去之。益州督護馮遷抽刀而前，玄拔頭上玉導與之，仍曰：「是何人邪？敢殺天子！」遷曰：「欲殺天子之賊耳。」遂斬之，時年三十六。又斬石康及浚等五級，庾頤之戰死。升云：「我是豫章王，諸君勿見殺。」送至江陵市斬之。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-2644703-raw.wikitext","raw_start":9210,"raw_end":9417,"character_positions":[9212,9213,9214,9215,9216,9217,9218,9219,9220,9221,9222,9223,9224,9225,9226,9227,9228,9229,9230,9231,9232,9233,9234,9235,9236,9237,9238,9239,9240,9241,9242,9243,9244,9245,9246,9247,9248,9249,9250,9251,9252,9253,9254,9255,9256,9257,9258,9259,9260,9261,9262,9263,9264,9265,9266,9267,9268,9269,9270,9271,9272,9273,9274,9275,9276,9277,9278,9279,9280,9281,9282,9283,9284,9285,9286,9287,9288,9289,9290,9291,9292,9293,9294,9295,9296,9297,9298,9299,9300,9301,9302,9303,9304,9305,9306,9307,9308,9309,9310,9311,9312,9313,9314,9315,9316,9317,9318,9319,9320,9321,9322,9323,9324,9325,9326,9327,9328,9329,9330,9331,9332,9333,9334,9335,9336,9337,9338,9339,9340,9341,9342,9343,9344,9345,9346,9347,9